  {'id':'d263_110','subject':'english-communication','question':'Match: Col A: 1-Reading, 2-Writing, 3-Speaking, 4-Listening. Col B: P-decode written, Q-encode speech, R-decode speech, S-encode written. Col C: i-delivering a talk, ii-writing essay, iii-reading newspaper, iv-attending lecture','options':['1-P-iii, 2-S-ii, 3-Q-i, 4-R-iv','1-Q-i, 2-R-iv, 3-P-iii, 4-S-ii','1-S-ii, 2-P-iii, 3-R-iv, 4-Q-i','1-R-iv, 2-Q-i, 3-S-ii, 4-P-iii'],'correct':0,'explanation':'Reading (decode written=newspaper=iii), Writing (encode written=essay=ii), Speaking (encode speech=talk=i), Listening (decode speech=lecture=iv).','difficulty':'hard'},
