  {'id':'d263_115','subject':'english-communication','question':'What is a topic sentence in a paragraph?','options':['The last sentence that concludes','The sentence that states the main idea','A sentence with a question','A supporting detail sentence'],'correct':1,'explanation':'A topic sentence states the main idea of a paragraph and usually appears at the beginning.','difficulty':'easy'},
